@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 注册新账号（重复提交会返回 USERNAME_DUPLICATED）
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8

{
  "username": "test03",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "三号"
}

### 登录，成功后自动把 Cookie 存到 authCookie
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8

{
  "username": "test01",
  "password": "12345678"
}

@authCookie = {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 当前登录用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### 我的资源（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/my-resources?page=1&page_size=20
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### 我的收藏（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/my-favorites?page=1&page_size=20
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### 注销
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### 未登录访问 me，应返回 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
